{"title":"코코로 죠죠루 (6부)","artist":"Nero","sourceId":"reference:szOzKvcsR2xc94rLaTQ4","sourceHash":"e0dcaeccf29b3cc7330fea45b08e1b537f75c0c85dcb61bcf029662f30acc332","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lyric_character_matching","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.141,"end":3.334,"text":"全ての『始まり』に…『重力』があった！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.334,"end":5.444,"text":"世界は星の周りを回るッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":5.444,"end":7.088,"text":"『人はなぜ出会うのか？』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":7.088,"end":9.401,"text":"君は…　「引力」を信じるか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":9.401,"end":10.025,"text":"オラァーッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":10.025,"end":11.601,"text":"あたしをジョジョって呼ぶな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":11.601,"end":12.393,"text":"オオオシャアアアアアアアーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":12.393,"end":12.962,"text":"じゃまだぜッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":12.962,"end":14.035,"text":"どきやがれェェェェーッ（ヘイッ！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":14.035,"end":15.027,"text":"「空条徐倫」！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":15.027,"end":16.256,"text":"『一手』遅カッタナ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":17.151,"end":18.134,"text":"時よ止まれェェェー！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":18.134,"end":19.134,"text":"そんな……どうして！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":19.134,"end":20.09,"text":"おまえのことは……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":20.09,"end":22.298,"text":"いつだって大切に思っていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":22.298,"end":23.253,"text":"徐倫！ 徐倫！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":23.253,"end":23.895,"text":"おねえちゃん！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":23.895,"end":26.764,"text":"あたしは…この「石の海」から自由になる…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":26.764,"end":28.784,"text":"『グリーン・ドルフィン・ストリート刑務所』………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":28.784,"end":30.727,"text":"ここは『最高厳重警備』！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":30.727,"end":32.06,"text":"でも　脱獄するのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":32.06,"end":33.179,"text":"できると思ってるの？（ヘイッ！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":33.179,"end":34.236,"text":"ジョリ～～～ン　ジョリ～～～ン","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":34.236,"end":35.111,"text":"ジョッリィヒヒィィ～～～～ン！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":35.111,"end":36.148,"text":"そうだ パンティーッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":36.148,"end":38.24,"text":"おまえパンティーもらった事あるッ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":38.24,"end":39.55,"text":"本当にくれるの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":39.55,"end":40.441,"text":"もうあげちゃうわッ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":40.441,"end":40.99,"text":"ハィイイイイイ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":40.99,"end":42.892,"text":"ただし命令するのはあたし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":42.892,"end":43.804,"text":"やれやれだわ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":43.804,"end":45.474,"text":"あたしはあんたを守りたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":45.474,"end":48.0,"text":"監房に囚人として行くってこと？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":48.0,"end":49.111,"text":"楽しいねェここ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":49.111,"end":50.488,"text":"キャッチボールっていうんだろ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":50.488,"end":52.265,"text":"続かない方に100ドル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":52.265,"end":54.468,"text":"勝ったッ！　おまえの「臓器」も「DISC」もッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":54.468,"end":55.898,"text":"あたしのものだああああああーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":55.898,"end":58.644,"text":"『キャッチボール』はあと800か…900か……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":58.644,"end":59.668,"text":"いや面倒だ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":59.668,"end":60.593,"text":"1000球だ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":60.593,"end":61.343,"text":"オラァーッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":61.343,"end":62.635,"text":"今だ！『ストーン・フリィィィーッ！！』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":62.635,"end":63.276,"text":"徐倫ッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":63.276,"end":63.868,"text":"とどめだッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":63.868,"end":64.986,"text":"『ウェザー・リポート』！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":64.986,"end":66.953,"text":"ガラスで墓碑銘を刻み込んでやるッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":66.953,"end":69.038,"text":"おまえを吹き戻してくれてるぞォォォォォ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":69.038,"end":70.134,"text":"『ホワイトスネイク』！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":70.134,"end":71.321,"text":"おまえに命令するッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":71.321,"end":71.882,"text":"勝った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":71.882,"end":73.327,"text":"この死にぞこないがああああああ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":73.327,"end":74.29,"text":"エルメェス！ F・F！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":74.29,"end":75.632,"text":"エンポリオ！ ウェザー・リポート！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":75.632,"end":77.798,"text":"「DISC」は父さんに戻す…必ず！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":77.798,"end":79.953,"text":"徐倫！これはあたしの問題だ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":79.953,"end":82.04,"text":"お前たちには関係ねぇッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":82.04,"end":86.16,"text":"「復讐」とは自分の運命への決着をつけるためにあるッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":86.16,"end":88.244,"text":"とどめを刺すのはこのオレだああああああーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":88.244,"end":90.496,"text":"いいか…この蹴りはグロリアのぶんだ……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":90.496,"end":91.509,"text":"これも！（次の次のも）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":91.509,"end":92.679,"text":"これも！これも！（その次の次のも）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":92.679,"end":93.8,"text":"これも！これも！これも！これも！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":93.8,"end":95.209,"text":"グロリアのぶんだあああーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":95.209,"end":97.201,"text":"ファイトクラブだ！！　かかって来いッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":97.201,"end":98.513,"text":"そのまま眠りなァ！！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":98.513,"end":100.008,"text":"教祖復活じゃあああああああああああああああ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":100.008,"end":100.943,"text":"『ダイバー・ダウン』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":100.943,"end":103.244,"text":"肉体そのものに『潜行』させた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":103.244,"end":103.973,"text":"やれやれだわ……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":103.973,"end":106.085,"text":"『ひとりの囚人は壁を見ていた』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":106.085,"end":108.532,"text":"『もうひとりの囚人は星を見ていた』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":108.532,"end":109.701,"text":"あたしはどっちだ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":109.701,"end":111.332,"text":"星の光を見ていたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":111.332,"end":112.188,"text":"決着ゥゥーーーーッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":112.188,"end":112.96,"text":"『ヨーヨーマッ』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":112.96,"end":114.935,"text":"このわたくしと闘いますか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":114.935,"end":116.293,"text":"用意をするんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":116.293,"end":119.672,"text":"この世に生まれてきたことを後悔する用意をだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":119.672,"end":121.459,"text":"完全なる死の忘却へ……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":121.459,"end":123.382,"text":"おまえを送り込んでおかなくては………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":123.382,"end":125.546,"text":"おまえから奪うべきものは3つ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":125.546,"end":126.647,"text":"『父の記憶』と","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":126.647,"end":127.374,"text":"『DISC』と","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":127.374,"end":128.527,"text":"おまえの『生命』だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":128.527,"end":129.233,"text":"オラァアアッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":129.233,"end":130.549,"text":"手錠は初めてか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"88","start":130.549,"end":131.25,"text":"ウオシャアアアア！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"89","start":131.25,"end":133.015,"text":"もらったッ　ストーン・フリーを！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"90","start":133.015,"end":134.726,"text":"数ミリメートルで決着がつく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"91","start":134.726,"end":136.936,"text":"これで共に旅立てるぞッ！DIOッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"92","start":136.936,"end":138.367,"text":"あたしは空条徐倫ッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"93","start":138.367,"end":141.207,"text":"あいつが得たものを「封印」しなければならないッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"94","start":141.207,"end":142.434,"text":"『スタンド』『友』『魂』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"95","start":142.434,"end":143.436,"text":"『言葉』『勇気』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"96","start":143.436,"end":145.665,"text":"それが『天国の時』であろう……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"97","start":145.665,"end":147.702,"text":"「C-MOON」！『重力』は逆転する","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"98","start":147.702,"end":149.935,"text":"最高だぜ…「ボヘミアン・ラプソディー」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"99","start":149.935,"end":152.011,"text":"オレは「アポロ11号」なんだァーーーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"100","start":152.011,"end":154.903,"text":"オレだって幸せになる権利はあるんだッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"101","start":154.903,"end":157.501,"text":"思い出のない人間は死人と同じだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"102","start":157.501,"end":158.901,"text":"「どこへ行かれるのですか？（ドミネ・クオ・ヴァディス）」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"103","start":158.901,"end":160.234,"text":"おまえは「磔刑」だーーーーッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"104","start":160.234,"end":162.824,"text":"おまえは………自分が『悪』だと気づいていない…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"105","start":162.824,"end":164.556,"text":"もっともドス黒い『悪』だ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"106","start":164.556,"end":166.571,"text":"徐倫と農場で出会って………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"107","start":166.571,"end":168.953,"text":"それからのことはなんでも覚えている………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"108","start":168.953,"end":172.468,"text":"生きるという事はきっと「思い出」を作る事なんだ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"109","start":172.468,"end":175.134,"text":"「思い出」が細胞に勇気を与えてくれる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"110","start":175.134,"end":176.823,"text":"そうだ…それが……それこそが！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"111","start":176.823,"end":178.532,"text":"人間のエネルギーなんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"112","start":178.532,"end":180.192,"text":"それが「知性」なんだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"113","start":180.192,"end":181.814,"text":"『時は加速』する","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"114","start":181.814,"end":182.929,"text":"太陽が……夕陽…………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"115","start":182.929,"end":183.966,"text":"なんだこれはッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"116","start":183.966,"end":186.056,"text":"『時間』だ……それも『加速』しているッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"117","start":186.056,"end":187.981,"text":"まさかッ！これが能力の『完成』！！？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"118","start":187.981,"end":189.993,"text":"あいつが狙っているのは「決着」……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"119","start":189.993,"end":193.761,"text":"「ジョースターの血」との「決着」をつけなくてはと考えているッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"120","start":193.761,"end":195.394,"text":"わたしの新たなスタンド……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"121","start":195.394,"end":197.501,"text":"名を冠するなら「メイド・イン・ヘブン」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"122","start":197.501,"end":198.15,"text":"オラァーッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"123","start":198.15,"end":199.561,"text":"絶対に放しちゃだめだァァァーーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"124","start":199.561,"end":200.08,"text":"来るぞーーッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"125","start":200.08,"end":201.447,"text":"さらに撃てッ！エンポリオ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"126","start":201.447,"end":202.396,"text":"『海』に出ろッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"127","start":202.396,"end":205.168,"text":"「ダイバー・ダウン」が最初のダメージを引き受ける！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"128","start":205.168,"end":206.643,"text":"道がひとつしかなくても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"129","start":206.643,"end":209.143,"text":"考えがあるなら きっとうまくいく道","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"130","start":209.143,"end":209.947,"text":"「ストーン・フリィィィーーーッ！！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"131","start":209.947,"end":210.447,"text":"「キッス！！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"132","start":210.447,"end":210.947,"text":"今だッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"133","start":210.947,"end":213.156,"text":"「スタープラチナ ザ・ワールド」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"134","start":213.156,"end":214.976,"text":"くらえ　プッチ神……！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"135","start":214.976,"end":217.249,"text":"うおおおおおおおおおおおお","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"136","start":217.249,"end":218.878,"text":"「二手」 遅れたようだな…………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"137","start":218.878,"end":219.452,"text":"うわあああああああああああああ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"138","start":219.452,"end":220.88,"text":"『運命』はここで終わりだッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"139","start":220.88,"end":221.614,"text":"オラァーッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"140","start":221.614,"end":222.131,"text":"おねえちゃんッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"141","start":222.131,"end":223.083,"text":"空条徐倫！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"142","start":223.083,"end":224.198,"text":"決着はつけるッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"143","start":224.198,"end":226.85,"text":"「因果」を未来へ持って行く事は出来ないッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"144","start":226.85,"end":229.839,"text":"あんたを逃がすのはアナスイであり……エルメェスであり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"145","start":229.839,"end":230.812,"text":"あたしの父さん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"146","start":230.812,"end":231.312,"text":"うわああああああああ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"147","start":231.312,"end":232.882,"text":"ここはあたしがくい止める","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"148","start":232.882,"end":234.793,"text":"来いッ！プッチ神父","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"149","start":234.793,"end":238.678,"text":"おねえちゃああああああーーーん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"150","start":245.803,"end":249.0,"text":"『時の加速』によって行きつく究極の所！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"151","start":249.0,"end":250.563,"text":"『宇宙』は一巡したッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"152","start":250.563,"end":254.636,"text":"明日「死ぬ」とわかっていても「覚悟」があるから幸福なんだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"153","start":254.636,"end":256.534,"text":"運命は決して変えられない…………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"154","start":256.534,"end":257.701,"text":"覚悟を決めろッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"155","start":257.701,"end":260.455,"text":"運命は決まっていて変えられない………のなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"156","start":260.455,"end":262.681,"text":"おまえに変えてもらう事にしたよ……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"157","start":262.681,"end":263.217,"text":"うぬおおおおおおおおお","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"158","start":263.217,"end":264.497,"text":"ウェザー・リポートの能力！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"159","start":264.497,"end":265.315,"text":"エンポリオ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"160","start":265.315,"end":266.911,"text":"貧弱さを思い知れェエーーーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"161","start":266.911,"end":269.267,"text":"徐倫おねえちゃんが持っててくれって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"162","start":269.267,"end":271.022,"text":"授けてくれたDISCだァァーーーーーーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"163","start":271.022,"end":271.634,"text":"プッチ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"164","start":271.634,"end":273.226,"text":"人の出会いも「重力」！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"165","start":273.226,"end":275.385,"text":"あんたは因縁が切れなかった！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"166","start":275.385,"end":276.335,"text":"ちっぽけな小僧がああああああああああ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"167","start":276.335,"end":277.469,"text":"わからないのか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"168","start":277.469,"end":280.054,"text":"おまえは「運命」に負けたんだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"169","start":280.435,"end":283.244,"text":"これがあたしなの　さよならを言うあたしなのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"170","start":283.244,"end":285.218,"text":"「キッス」は復讐の「許可証」！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"171","start":285.218,"end":287.245,"text":"オレは自分の人生を呪っている……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"172","start":287.245,"end":289.327,"text":"祝福しろ　それが必要だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"173","start":289.327,"end":291.101,"text":"もちろんあたしは星を見るわ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"174","start":291.101,"end":293.259,"text":"生きのびるのよ　あんたは「希望」！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"175","start":293.259,"end":296.035,"text":"「正義の道」を歩む事こそ「運命」なんだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"176","start":296.035,"end":299.51,"text":"ぼくの名前はエンポリオです","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}